  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Stabilisation and Safe Reintegration in north-east Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support persons returning to their areas of origin in north-east Syria, including the reintegration of individuals released from the camps, and to avoid radicalisation and discrimination, ensure social cohesion, access to health and protection from risks posed by landmines and unexploded devices.</narrative>
  </description>
